sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant Merchant
    participant PaymentSystem as Payment System
    participant PSP as Payment Service Provider
    participant Ledger as Ledger
    participant Reconcile as Settlement Reconcile

    Client->>Merchant: Checkout
    Merchant->>PaymentSystem: Create Payment Intent
    PaymentSystem-->>Merchant: Return Client Secret
    Merchant-->>Client: Init Payment UI
    Client->>PSP: PSP Redirect / Token Auth
    PSP-->>Client: Auth Response
    PSP->>PaymentSystem: Webhook Ingress
    PaymentSystem->>Ledger: Ledger Post (Record Transaction)
    Ledger-->>PaymentSystem: Ledger Updated
    PaymentSystem-->>PSP: Webhook Ack
    Reconcile->>PSP: Fetch Settlement Batch
    PSP-->>Reconcile: Batch Data
    Reconcile->>PaymentSystem: Settlement Reconcile
    PaymentSystem->>Ledger: Ledger Post (Update Status)
    Ledger-->>PaymentSystem: Ledger Updated
